msgid "plugins.generic.tadabburSuite.name"
msgstr "Tadabbur Suite (all tools in one plugin)"

msgid "plugins.generic.tadabburSuite.description"
msgstr "One plugin containing all the journal tools as modules. Installed and upgraded once, groups their sidebar entries under a single item, and keeps the editor-in-chief signature, stamp and letterhead outside the plugin folder. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah for Research and Studies."

