msgid "plugins.generic.tadabburSuite.branding"
msgstr "Shared journal branding"

msgid "plugins.generic.tadabburSuite.brandingHelp"
msgstr "Upload the editor-in-chief signature, stamp and letterhead here; they are used at once in official letters, reviewer certificates and review forms. They are stored in the files folder outside the plugin, so no update erases them, and the default image can be restored at any time. When the editor-in-chief changes, upload the name and signature (and blue signature) together."

